{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfMVVSUfpWZSEdjugoWuM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0146siPerUjhxmAkC4yVNsSw","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/spec.md","content":"# Spec: Dark-Mode Toggle\n\nStatus: ready-for-agent\n\n## Summary\nAdd a theme control to the Settings page so users can choose between light and dark modes, or follow their OS setting.\n\n## Options\n- **System** (default): follows `prefers-color-scheme` and updates live when the OS setting changes.\n- **Light**: always light.\n- **Dark**: always dark.\n\n## Behavior\n- The selection is saved per user in their profile (e.g., `themePreference: \"system\" | \"light\" | \"dark\"`).\n- New and existing users with no saved value default to **System**.\n- Changing the setting applies immediately, with no page reload.\n- The preference follows the user across devices and sessions.\n- Apply the theme before first paint (for example, from a cached value) so the page doesn't flash the wrong theme.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n1. The Settings page shows a three-option theme control.\n2. The selection persists to the user profile and survives logout/login.\n3. System mode tracks OS changes in real time.\n4. All pages meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes.\n5. If saving fails, show an error and revert the control.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":225,"cache_read_input_tokens":15085,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":225},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"a5d74760-a1d2-4451-8ec2-9067ee8b26a6","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:41:01.064Z","request_id":"req_011CfMVVRxRQW7C9pAC3a1G8","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0146siPerUjhxmAkC4yVNsSw":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/spec.md","content":"# Spec: Dark-Mode Toggle\n\nStatus: ready-for-agent\n\n## Summary\nAdd a theme control to the Settings page so users can choose between light and dark modes, or follow their OS setting.\n\n## Options\n- **System** (default): follows `prefers-color-scheme` and updates live when the OS setting changes.\n- **Light**: always light.\n- **Dark**: always dark.\n\n## Behavior\n- The selection is saved per user in their profile (e.g., `themePreference: \"system\" | \"light\" | \"dark\"`).\n- New and existing users with no saved value default to **System**.\n- Changing the setting applies immediately, with no page reload.\n- The preference follows the user across devices and sessions.\n- Apply the theme before first paint (for example, from a cached value) so the page doesn't flash the wrong theme.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n1. The Settings page shows a three-option theme control.\n2. The selection persists to the user profile and survives logout/login.\n3. System mode tracks OS changes in real time.\n4. All pages meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes.\n5. If saving fails, show an error and revert the control.\n"}}}
